# Goope

> A simple and easy-to-use website builder for small businesses in Japan

Goope is a Japanese website creation service provided by GMO Pepabo, Inc. It allows anyone to create a professional website in as little as 30 minutes, with no programming or design skills required.

## Key Features

- Choose from a variety of design templates
- No server setup or software installation needed
- Update your website from your smartphone
- Ranked No.1 in Japan for "Ease of Setup", "Usability", and "Customer Satisfaction"

## Main Functions

### Content Creation
- Design templates
- Slideshow
- Photo album
- Menu pages (for restaurants, salons, etc.)
- Calendar
- Staff introduction
- Free pages (unlimited)
- Job posting pages
- Blog
- PDF upload

### Marketing & Sales
- Shopping cart
- Reservation form
- Coupon creation
- Contact form
- Easy SEO settings
- Access analytics
- Social media auto-posting

### Integrations
- PayPal
- Color Me Shop (Japanese e-commerce platform)
- minne (Japanese handmade marketplace)
- Google Maps
- Google Jobs
- X (Twitter)
- LINE
- Facebook
- Instagram

### Security & Other
- Free SSL certificate
- Two-factor authentication
- Custom domain setup
- Email address creation
- Sub-administrator settings
- Mobile-optimized design

## Pricing Plans

- **Light Plan**: From 1,210 JPY/month (1,331 JPY including tax)
