## Target Users

Goope is ideal for small business owners and sole proprietors in Japan, including:
- Restaurants and cafes
- Beauty salons and spas
- Retail shops
- Schools and classes
- Professional services (lawyers, accountants, etc.)
- Clinics
- Event organizers

